#
# No DriverKit matching is used.  Per H1_HARDWARE_INTERROGATION_DECISION.md the
# generic SVGA (IOVGADisplay, legacy VGA only) is the sole display owner and
# MatroxMGA is not loaded, so the MGA native BARs are unowned.
#
# stage 0: PCI config READ only.
# stage 1: stage 0 report + config-space BAR sizing (write 0xFFFFFFFF, read
#          size mask, restore original, verify restore).  Configuration space
#          only; the PCI command register is not modified.
# stage 2: stage 0 report + read-only MMIO characterization.  Maps BAR1
#          (16 KiB) with IOMapPhysicalIntoIOTask, reads only the verified
#          read-only registers (DWGCTL/FIFOSTATUS/STATUS/VCOUNT/OPMODE/MEMCTL,
#          common to G400 and G450), samples VCOUNT to prove a live uncached
#          mapping, then unmaps.  It never writes a register, never touches
#          Reset (0x1e40) or EXEC (0x0100), and does not change PCI config.
#
# Set the argument below: 0 read-only PCI, 1 BAR sizing, 2 MMIO read.
#
CALL openStepMGAProbeEntry 4
WIRE
START
